# Dropped sources (kind 5): the registry's drop=[...] / nosrc leave a source file of the real mmp out of a build.
# Each line: reason component source   (source = the file's lower-case base name; `*` = nosrc, the whole mmp source list)
# One line per (component, source) any architecture drops; tools/stub_audit.py check fails on a drop with no line here,
# and on a line no registry entry drops any more (delete it: the list only shrinks). Reasons: dropped-reasons.txt.
# Regenerate nothing by hand without reading the replacement: `stub_audit.py dropped` lists what the registry drops now.
